        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"7f057d48-0855-4325-950b-44f9e6fc2ee1\",\"review_text\":\"Disgusting app 1 minute of add after every 2 songs i am buying amazon prime music. Do something on this situation or your app will be meme material in future #Garibapp bhikari app\"},{\"review_id\":\"ae2e8bbc-49a5-4e88-a9b3-0432f7405274\",\"review_text\":\"Super all and nice all songs 😍I am daily use this app\"},{\"review_id\":\"b0fb4c8e-e2be-432d-84bc-b4f30b0d2aa5\",\"review_text\":\"Hate this application 😡😡😡👎🏻\"},{\"review_id\":\"e6327fbf-61c6-4020-99da-5fd3a2e860d8\",\"review_text\":\"Top best and lovely app for songs\"},{\"review_id\":\"8454aa1e-ceb7-4676-adf7-e20f6989f5c9\",\"review_text\":\"Super\"},{\"review_id\":\"3835deb6-e411-4ba9-9b7c-d51a5e13c34c\",\"review_text\":\"Now with the Enhanced feature I have almost limitless music recommendation catering to my taste. Insanely good. Worth the premium.\"},{\"review_id\":\"85e978f0-13e5-4264-8d3d-251ac5c36461\",\"review_text\":\"Good app but the ads are also like crazy there is a video when you listening music\"},{\"review_id\":\"ac480d7d-1af8-48ab-b581-ab13ede82e67\",\"review_text\":\"❤️ it its yes yes and very easy to set up a program for your love of music...\"},{\"review_id\":\"cf94f912-2dbc-4e23-b531-ee92dd0e4f4f\",\"review_text\":\"Love it. You rock Spotify. Keep it up!\"},{\"review_id\":\"7eaaccd9-bf5a-4bdf-b5a0-31abbe500039\",\"review_text\":\"Always available with the latest music etc.\"}]}"
